  "title": {
   "en": "Suruga Meteor"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "スルガメテオ"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "At that batting center, there's a pitching machine no one can hit—hurling a blistering 160 km/h fastball, the \"Suruga Meteor\".\nBut its true identity? A ridiculously thick-bottomed, shy 15-year-old boy!?  \n\nWith an overzealous captain and a small baseball club operating in the shadows, their dream is clear: “We’ll play baseball under the blue sky!”\nFrom the dim, cramped backlot of the batting cages, they set their sights on Koshien!  \n\nA \"super-charged youth\" baseball tale, brought to you by a fiery captain and a timid genius rookie!\n\n(Source: Pocket Shonen Magazine, edited)",
   "ja": "そのバッティングセンターには誰にも打てないマシンがある。\n砂塵を巻き上げる160km/hの剛速球「スルガメテオ」。\nその正体はなんと、とんでもなく尻のデカい15歳の内気な少年だった!?\n熱血すぎるキャプテンに、日陰で活動する小さな野球部。\n「青い空の下で楽しい野球をするんだ！」暗くて狭いバッセンの裏から目指すは夢の甲子園！\n熱血キャプテンと内気な天才新入生贈る、“超青春”野球譚!!",
   "tr": "Vuruş merkezinde kimsenin vuramayacağı bir makine var.\n``Suruga Meteor'' saatte 160 km hızla toz kaldıran hızlı bir toptur.\nGerçek kimliği, gülünç derecede büyük poposu olan, 15 yaşında, utangaç bir çocuktur!\nAşırı tutkulu kaptanın gölgesinde faaliyet gösteren küçük bir beyzbol takımı.\n``Mavi gökyüzünün altında eğlenceli beyzbol oynayalım!''"
  },
